			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Atomize Vine client into PascalCase submodules\n\nDecompose the monolithic `Source/Vine/Client.rs` (800+ lines) into a dedicated submodule tree to align with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention. Extract logical units into explicit files: `ConnectToSideCar`, `SendRequest`, `SendNotification`, `MarkShutdown`, `NotificationFrame`, and `Shared` (statics). Rename all functions to `PascalCase::Fn` pattern (e.g., `connect_to_sidecar` → `ConnectToSideCar::Fn`).\n\nUpdate `Multiplexer` to invoke `PublishNotificationFromMux::Fn` via the new path. Adjust `MountainVinegRPCService` to call `DispatchSideCarRequest::DispatchSideCarRequest`. Minor formatting cleanup in `Notification` handlers for consistency.\n\nThis structural refactor eliminates implicit imports, enforces strict naming standards across the Vine gRPC layer, and establishes a consistent namespace hierarchy for the streaming multiplexer integration.",
